      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_1fbamzdfvh",
          "type": "heading",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "text": "My journey to song",
            "level": "h2",
            "size": "auto",
            "eyebrow": "Finding my voice"
          },
          "variant": "plain",
          "style": {
            "align": {
              "d": "center"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_a5ans1zb6c",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "As a child, singing was my greatest joy. Yet there was a moment when my voice was criticized, and my song turned silent for over ten years. It took a breakup and a flood of emotions to rediscover the transformative power of my own voice."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "In the depths of despair, I turned to journaling, and singing the words on the page became a visceral, cathartic experience. It awakened the knowing that I could express my emotions through sound — a pivotal moment that ignited my passion for music and self-expression."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "My journey led me to study sound healing, sacred song facilitation, medicine music, and the transformative practice of yoga of the voice. I now love helping people unlock the full potential of their voice and discover its power for healing, fulfillment, and embodiment."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
